        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Companies: Hidden City Entertainment, Hidden City Games, Inc.\n- People: Jesper Myrfors, Paul Peterson\n- Products: Clout Fantasy, Bella Sara\n- Places: Seattle, Sweden\n\nFacts:\n- Jesper Myrfors was born around 1964 in Sweden.\n- Hidden City Entertainment was founded in 2004 as Hidden City Games, Inc.\n- Jesper Myrfors and Paul Peterson founded Hidden City Games, Inc. to develop and market the chip-throwing game Clout Fantasy.\n- Jesper Myrfors is a founding member of Hidden City Games and Clout Fantasy.\n- Hidden City Entertainment is a Seattle-based game company.\n- Bella Sara was published by Hidden City Entertainment.\n- Bella Sara began as a trading card game and later expanded into an international product line.",
